  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ん……ん──\r\nプロデューサー……？　おかえりなさい……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "006",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わ、咲耶……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "今日は直帰……じゃなかったかい……？",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、名刺を切らしたから\r\nそれを取りに……いや、それよりも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ひとりか？　はづきさんは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ええと……今日は遅くなると言ったら、\r\n特別に鍵を貸してくれて……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "少しだけ休んでから帰るつもりが、\r\n──ふぁ、寝てしまっていたのか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "でも……おかげでプロデューサーを\r\n迎えることができたね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫か？　熱とかあるんじゃないよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、うたたねしてしまっただけさ\r\n体調はなんともない",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら、まあいいが……\r\n……疲れてるなら、ちゃんと休めよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ん……５人の仕事がまた増えてきたから、\r\n頑張りたくてね……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──ありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ん？　どうした？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "意図的に増やしてくれているんだろう？\r\n……ちゃんと気付いてるよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うーん……？\r\nユニットとしての仕事は当たり前のことだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クスッ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタは優しいね……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "でも……今回、学んだことによると、\r\n相手の気持ちは素直に受け取るべきなんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私も……つい遠慮してしまったりするけれど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "一方的に与えようとするのは……\r\nみんなに失礼なことだとわかったから……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──だから……もう一度言うよ？\r\nありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──わかった\r\nじゃ、どういたしまして",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフッ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、咲耶が学んだことのついでに\r\n俺からも、ひとつ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶が誰かを愛するように、\r\n……咲耶も、愛されていることを忘れないようにな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………えっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "あ、ああ……うん……\r\n…………えっと？　それは……だ、誰から？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、ファンと……\r\nアンティーカのみんなからだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ああ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに俺だって、咲耶を大事に思っているんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから……事務所のソファで寝るのはダメだ\r\n風邪を引くぞ！　家のベッドでゆっくり休むように！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ッ──……フフ……ハハッ………！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほらほら、のんきに喋ってる時間じゃないぞ\r\n途中まで送っていくから、支度してくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "わかったわかった、すぐに支度するよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006002020250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……敵わないな、アナタって人には──",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600202/1006002020250"
  },
